(4376109, 630467, 16648, '<td valign="top">poorly lit, poorly posed, small size. hey, it''s not overexposed! terrible, just terrible, location - a bed with a cell phone?<br/>It need not be fine art, but please at lease show you put some effort into it. This could just be a cell phone snapshot, and for that, well, you get a lower than average score. Sorry.</td>', 'poorly lit, poorly posed, small size. hey, it''s not overexposed! terrible, just terrible, location - a bed with a cell phone?It need not be fine art, but please at lease show you put some effort into it. This could just be a cell phone snapshot, and for that, well, you get a lower than average score. Sorry.', '2008-01-09 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376111, 630628, 39675, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Especially for your first entry.  You might beat mine this week.  Excellent color and focus.  I can tell you''ve taken this kind of shot before.</td>', 'Excellent!  Especially for your first entry.  You might beat mine this week.  Excellent color and focus.  I can tell you''ve taken this kind of shot before.', '2008-01-09 00:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376126, 630634, 39675, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfect in this photograph.  The texture of the hear is great.  I like the way you used the bushes to isolate the focus of your photo.</td>', 'The lighting is perfect in this photograph.  The texture of the hear is great.  I like the way you used the bushes to isolate the focus of your photo.', '2008-01-09 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376137, 630714, 16648, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you''re using for acamera or lens, but you lack contrast here as if you had lens flare or just a plastic lens. Color seems off a bit too. Not sharp.</td>', 'Not sure what you''re using for acamera or lens, but you lack contrast here as if you had lens flare or just a plastic lens. Color seems off a bit too. Not sharp.', '2008-01-09 00:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376143, 629497, 16648, '<td valign="top">could use more contast, a tad more sharpening, and it''s weebit (1/3 to 1/2 stop) underexposed</td>', 'could use more contast, a tad more sharpening, and it''s weebit (1/3 to 1/2 stop) underexposed', '2008-01-09 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376144, 630626, 39675, '<td valign="top">Your model did an excellent job and you did a great job capturing the moment.</td>', 'Your model did an excellent job and you did a great job capturing the moment.', '2008-01-09 00:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376166, 629529, 16648, '<td valign="top">Your white balance is terrible on this. And it''s not sharp (perhaps not in focus or suffers from camera shake or motion blur). WAY too yello. The TP or toilet (it''s white?) or perhaps the margins of the comic in his hands could be used to find an acceptable WB point. Compostion and the idea are nice. A but more prep on the scene would have helped -the washcloth on the towel rack could have been nicer, not there or something that added to the humor, for example.</td>', 'Your white balance is terrible on this. And it''s not sharp (perhaps not in focus or suffers from camera shake or motion blur). WAY too yello. The TP or toilet (it''s white?) or perhaps the margins of the comic in his hands could be used to find an acceptable WB point. Compostion and the idea are nice. A but more prep on the scene would have helped -the washcloth on the towel rack could have been nicer, not there or something that added to the humor, for example.', '2008-01-09 00:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4376168, 630627, 39675, '<td valign="top">I like this even more now that I see it at home.  You''re right though, it does seem very commercial.  I can''t wait to see what you can do when you have a week to work on the challenge and do something that YOU like.</td>', 'I like this even more now that I see it at home.  You''re right though, it does seem very commercial.  I can''t wait to see what you can do when you have a week to work on the challenge and do something that YOU like.', '2008-01-09 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
