(4376198, 629093, 16648, '<td valign="top">DNMC (well...not a portrait really), underexposed a great deal, heavy border (but the image is so dark I almost didn''t see it) and you''ve cut off woody''s foot in a weird way - crop more or less, but not this, this looks like a careless accident type of thing.</td>', 'DNMC (well...not a portrait really), underexposed a great deal, heavy border (but the image is so dark I almost didn''t see it) and you''ve cut off woody''s foot in a weird way - crop more or less, but not this, this looks like a careless accident type of thing.', '2008-01-09 00:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
