(4376207, 630781, 69325, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but i laughed outloud when i saw this. i''ve seen people shoehorn some nudity but i just aint gettin this one....a woman reading the bible and a nipple slip? you''re going to have to help me here...</td>', 'I''m sorry, but i laughed outloud when i saw this. i''ve seen people shoehorn some nudity but i just aint gettin this one....a woman reading the bible and a nipple slip? you''re going to have to help me here...', '2008-01-09 00:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
