(4378427, 629134, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural light. I''d crop much tighter - i don''t think that much background is needed.</td>', 'Good use of natural light. I''d crop much tighter - i don''t think that much background is needed.', '2008-01-09 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378436, 630542, 77543, '<td valign="top">The main point of focus is the large white light rather than the face. I''d have thought more about the lighting in this picture.</td>', 'The main point of focus is the large white light rather than the face. I''d have thought more about the lighting in this picture.', '2008-01-09 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378440, 629778, 77543, '<td valign="top">This picture is strong enough without so much post-processing.</td>', 'This picture is strong enough without so much post-processing.', '2008-01-09 16:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378449, 630791, 55212, '<td valign="top">This would be cute but your eye goes straight for the orange ribbon by his front paw.</td>', 'This would be cute but your eye goes straight for the orange ribbon by his front paw.', '2008-01-09 16:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378450, 628595, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s nicely exposed and sharp. It looks like this picture hasn''t been cropped at all - I''d remove all the excess space above the top of the head.</td>', 'It''s nicely exposed and sharp. It looks like this picture hasn''t been cropped at all - I''d remove all the excess space above the top of the head.', '2008-01-09 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378473, 629788, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good pose and lighting. I don''t like the crop at the bottom - you''ve just clipped the hand.</td>', 'Good pose and lighting. I don''t like the crop at the bottom - you''ve just clipped the hand.', '2008-01-09 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378534, 629782, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a young Julia Roberts!</td>', 'It''s a young Julia Roberts!', '2008-01-09 16:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378538, 630265, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very nice! It has that sense of fashion model about it...glamorous. I do think, however, that lighting could be improved a in two places. Some reflected fill light could ease the harsh shadow cast by the nose. And somehow back-lighting to prevent the second half of the glasses from merging with the void...perhaps it would have only taken a half step into the light toward the camera to pull up that detail. Even so, the image has immediate impact. The colors are a delight. The expression serious without being overly self-conscious. Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice! It has that sense of fashion model about it...glamorous. I do think, however, that lighting could be improved a in two places. Some reflected fill light could ease the harsh shadow cast by the nose. And somehow back-lighting to prevent the second half of the glasses from merging with the void...perhaps it would have only taken a half step into the light toward the camera to pull up that detail. Even so, the image has immediate impact. The colors are a delight. The expression serious without being overly self-conscious. Nicely done!', '2008-01-09 16:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378545, 629093, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark.</td>', 'It''s very dark.', '2008-01-09 16:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378546, 630741, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good use of reflection. It would have been nice to get the book in both lenses.</td>', 'Good use of reflection. It would have been nice to get the book in both lenses.', '2008-01-09 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378548, 630778, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark around the eyes.</td>', 'It''s a little dark around the eyes.', '2008-01-09 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378551, 629515, 41864, '<td valign="top">Head a little too blown. Great shot though.</td>', 'Head a little too blown. Great shot though.', '2008-01-09 16:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378552, 629058, 77543, '<td valign="top">If only the cat was looking at the computer, too.<br/>:-)</td>', 'If only the cat was looking at the computer, too.:-)', '2008-01-09 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378553, 630637, 88544, '<td valign="top">I love this picture it is so awesome. love the tattoos.</td>', 'I love this picture it is so awesome. love the tattoos.', '2008-01-09 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4378555, 629992, 41864, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Like the tones.</td>', 'Very cute. Like the tones.', '2008-01-09 16:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
