(4381531, 630503, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and focus on eyes. Tilt gives it energy and fun. Lighting is a little harsh on the face and too dark in the background.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and focus on eyes. Tilt gives it energy and fun. Lighting is a little harsh on the face and too dark in the background.', '2008-01-10 13:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381532, 629650, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like using the window and the light from the window.  I might try to add a small light behind the subject down in the corner as a back light. Or maybe a small fill light from the upper left to bring out the details of the subject''s hair.</td>', 'I like using the window and the light from the window.  I might try to add a small light behind the subject down in the corner as a back light. Or maybe a small fill light from the upper left to bring out the details of the subject''s hair.', '2008-01-10 13:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381536, 630531, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow... very eye-catching! I especially like the reflection of the fireball in the glasses. If you could burn and dodge I''d like to see the face brighter but I don''t think you can achieve that within basic editing. I can''t decide if I''d like a faster shutter speed on the spray from the mouth... maybe.</td>', 'Wow... very eye-catching! I especially like the reflection of the fireball in the glasses. If you could burn and dodge I''d like to see the face brighter but I don''t think you can achieve that within basic editing. I can''t decide if I''d like a faster shutter speed on the spray from the mouth... maybe.', '2008-01-10 13:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381539, 630796, 29513, '<td valign="top">I think the darkness on the left side is a bit too deep.  I would like the see the details of the subject''s hair and face better.</td>', 'I think the darkness on the left side is a bit too deep.  I would like the see the details of the subject''s hair and face better.', '2008-01-10 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381541, 630790, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great highlights.  I might have cropped it a bit closer.</td>', 'Great highlights.  I might have cropped it a bit closer.', '2008-01-10 13:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381543, 629743, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the title of the book and image on it. Very fun. Your model looks especially cooperative. Great lighting on Mr. doggie. Nicely done. I might like a little more brightness on the book cover.</td>', 'I love the title of the book and image on it. Very fun. Your model looks especially cooperative. Great lighting on Mr. doggie. Nicely done. I might like a little more brightness on the book cover.', '2008-01-10 13:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381545, 630675, 88204, '<td valign="top">I think if he''s looking down I''d like to see his hand. Better yet I might like to see a glint in his eyes or a little more sign of emotion. I can''t tell if this is a stage or studio shot but the lighting is nice, especially if it''s a stage shot.</td>', 'I think if he''s looking down I''d like to see his hand. Better yet I might like to see a glint in his eyes or a little more sign of emotion. I can''t tell if this is a stage or studio shot but the lighting is nice, especially if it''s a stage shot.', '2008-01-10 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381547, 630427, 77543, '<td valign="top">The necklace is cut off. The background is quite busy.</td>', 'The necklace is cut off. The background is quite busy.', '2008-01-10 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381550, 630638, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle. Makes the subject look whimsical and fun. The hat, coat and beard seem to go well with the natural background. Good use of even colors. Nice warm light in the background... opportunity to get some of that warm light on the face.</td>', 'I like the wide angle. Makes the subject look whimsical and fun. The hat, coat and beard seem to go well with the natural background. Good use of even colors. Nice warm light in the background... opportunity to get some of that warm light on the face.', '2008-01-10 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381553, 630810, 88540, '<td valign="top">bigggg baby lol<br/>j/p its a really nice photo</td>', 'bigggg baby lolj/p its a really nice photo', '2008-01-10 13:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381555, 630481, 88542, '<td valign="top">Very Sophisticated...</td>', 'Very Sophisticated...', '2008-01-10 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381559, 630780, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think all of the nose should be visible. It''s over-exposed on one side. I''d be interested to find out how you managed to fade out the glasses with basic editing.</td>', 'I think all of the nose should be visible. It''s over-exposed on one side. I''d be interested to find out how you managed to fade out the glasses with basic editing.', '2008-01-10 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
