(4381563, 630504, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s an odd shape on the dark side cheek. Perhaps better positioning of the light of subject would have removed that.</td>', 'There''s an odd shape on the dark side cheek. Perhaps better positioning of the light of subject would have removed that.', '2008-01-10 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
