(4381823, 629281, 83845, '<td valign="top">technically well done.  Love the lighting.</td>', 'technically well done.  Love the lighting.', '2008-01-10 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381824, 630770, 87410, '<td valign="top">it looks like a mix of John Lennon and Snuffleupagus from Sesame Street.</td>', 'it looks like a mix of John Lennon and Snuffleupagus from Sesame Street.', '2008-01-10 15:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381829, 629093, 83845, '<td valign="top">seems a bit dark and half his foot is cut off.  nice idea.</td>', 'seems a bit dark and half his foot is cut off.  nice idea.', '2008-01-10 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381835, 629939, 5364, '<td valign="top">I find the bright white stripes rather distracting</td>', 'I find the bright white stripes rather distracting', '2008-01-10 15:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381843, 628976, 57229, '<td valign="top">What a lovely picture! You''ll probably be crucified by the voters though. Never mind, eh.</td>', 'What a lovely picture! You''ll probably be crucified by the voters though. Never mind, eh.', '2008-01-10 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381847, 630440, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how this is a portrait of someone. It''s all a bit too soft focus for my tastes as well</td>', 'I don''t get how this is a portrait of someone. It''s all a bit too soft focus for my tastes as well', '2008-01-10 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381849, 630278, 83845, '<td valign="top">love the composition and idea, plus technically well done.  One of the best I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'love the composition and idea, plus technically well done.  One of the best I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2008-01-10 15:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381852, 630814, 83845, '<td valign="top">a little red and washed out in some places, but nice composition</td>', 'a little red and washed out in some places, but nice composition', '2008-01-10 15:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381853, 630813, 83845, '<td valign="top">nice portrait with spectacles, lighting very nice, love the expression.</td>', 'nice portrait with spectacles, lighting very nice, love the expression.', '2008-01-10 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381854, 629086, 83845, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait. love the natural lighting</td>', 'very nice portrait. love the natural lighting', '2008-01-10 15:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381856, 630324, 5364, '<td valign="top">This looks horibly over processed - or has she used too much make-up?</td>', 'This looks horibly over processed - or has she used too much make-up?', '2008-01-10 15:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381857, 630606, 83845, '<td valign="top">I love the expression and the way she is folding her hands and seems to be taking a deep breadth.  I kinda wish the sunlight wasn''t so splotchy... but very nice picture.</td>', 'I love the expression and the way she is folding her hands and seems to be taking a deep breadth.  I kinda wish the sunlight wasn''t so splotchy... but very nice picture.', '2008-01-10 15:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381859, 629207, 83845, '<td valign="top">well, not exactly spectacles, but great composition and depth of field.</td>', 'well, not exactly spectacles, but great composition and depth of field.', '2008-01-10 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381861, 630795, 83845, '<td valign="top">a more interesting crop than some others.  Nice lighting and expression.</td>', 'a more interesting crop than some others.  Nice lighting and expression.', '2008-01-10 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381862, 629314, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking photo. I''m most intrigued by the beautiful soft focus. I''m dying to know how you did it. I have to guess it involved some kind of blur layer. The texture of the skin is dreamlike... very soothing and soft. There''s something else about the image that throws me a bit. The lack of an undershirt with the hands on the zipper is very suggestive, although the subject looks very young. This make me uncomfortable in that it''s a girl in the 14-18 year old range in a slightly suggestive image. The cross around her neck and the smooth texture make her seem very innocent and young which to me says it shouldn''t be suggestive. Anyway... you''ve captured my attention with the quality of the image and the the above turmoil I described. I''d love to hear more about what you intended.</td>', 'This is a very striking photo. I''m most intrigued by the beautiful soft focus. I''m dying to know how you did it. I have to guess it involved some kind of blur layer. The texture of the skin is dreamlike... very soothing and soft. There''s something else about the image that throws me a bit. The lack of an undershirt with the hands on the zipper is very suggestive, although the subject looks very young. This make me uncomfortable in that it''s a girl in the 14-18 year old range in a slightly suggestive image. The cross around her neck and the smooth texture make her seem very innocent and young which to me says it shouldn''t be suggestive. Anyway... you''ve captured my attention with the quality of the image and the the above turmoil I described. I''d love to hear more about what you intended.', '2008-01-10 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381864, 629058, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like how the cat and whiskers on the chin are both "furry". The cat seems very engaged in something on the screen. Black and white suits it well. Simple, plain image but interesting.</td>', 'I like how the cat and whiskers on the chin are both "furry". The cat seems very engaged in something on the screen. Black and white suits it well. Simple, plain image but interesting.', '2008-01-10 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381866, 629991, 83845, '<td valign="top">a better attempt at this idea than I''ve seen so far.  Some cropping may be in order, but very well done.</td>', 'a better attempt at this idea than I''ve seen so far.  Some cropping may be in order, but very well done.', '2008-01-10 15:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381871, 630714, 83845, '<td valign="top">the colors are a little drab, but that may have been intentional.  model did a good job.  nice composition.</td>', 'the colors are a little drab, but that may have been intentional.  model did a good job.  nice composition.', '2008-01-10 15:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381873, 630790, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the low key lighting with the face barely lit. I wish I could see a little more definition in the right eye that''s lit. The lens of the glasses looks dirty... maybe try to avoid the reflection or clean the lens or pop the glass out. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the low key lighting with the face barely lit. I wish I could see a little more definition in the right eye that''s lit. The lens of the glasses looks dirty... maybe try to avoid the reflection or clean the lens or pop the glass out. Nicely done.', '2008-01-10 15:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
