(4381899, 630409, 88204, '<td valign="top">The sharpness and definition in the face is wonderful! I agree... lots of stories behind this face. I like the highlights in the hair and the bright background to the right. The only thing I''d change is the title... I think I''d call it "A Face Full of Stories" and let the viewer decide if they''re sweet or not. Great shot!</td>', 'The sharpness and definition in the face is wonderful! I agree... lots of stories behind this face. I like the highlights in the hair and the bright background to the right. The only thing I''d change is the title... I think I''d call it "A Face Full of Stories" and let the viewer decide if they''re sweet or not. Great shot!', '2008-01-10 15:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4381900, 630796, 83845, '<td valign="top">beautiful model, excellent portrait!  love the natural lighting.</td>', 'beautiful model, excellent portrait!  love the natural lighting.', '2008-01-10 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
