(4383258, 629748, 33400, '<td valign="top">I love a picture that makes me look around to see what''s there.  This does that very well while still pulling me back into the subject.<br/>The rope first caught my attention.  It makes me wonder if there''s usually a line, or are we perhaps to understand that nowadays no one comes?<br/>The reflection in the glass door has me wondering if that''s someone waiting in the distance, or is it perhaps a lonely icon, waiting, like the patient Father, for someone.<br/>Being a lifelong protestant, I know I''m missing much richness here.  Bt htis is still a wonderful and interesting peek into the church.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'I love a picture that makes me look around to see what''s there.  This does that very well while still pulling me back into the subject.The rope first caught my attention.  It makes me wonder if there''s usually a line, or are we perhaps to understand that nowadays no one comes?The reflection in the glass door has me wondering if that''s someone waiting in the distance, or is it perhaps a lonely icon, waiting, like the patient Father, for someone.Being a lifelong protestant, I know I''m missing much richness here.  Bt htis is still a wonderful and interesting peek into the church.Nicely done.', '2008-01-10 22:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4383263, 630382, 88204, '<td valign="top">The face has character. I like that it''s off center and simple colors. Background might be better out of focus.</td>', 'The face has character. I like that it''s off center and simple colors. Background might be better out of focus.', '2008-01-10 22:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4383266, 630076, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and blurred background. The skin looks so child-smooth, with an overall smooth yet sharp feeling (did you use a blur layer?). Nice!</td>', 'I love the lighting and blurred background. The skin looks so child-smooth, with an overall smooth yet sharp feeling (did you use a blur layer?). Nice!', '2008-01-10 22:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
