(4386002, 629314, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very pretty subject and interesting use of light.  I''m a little concerned with the soft processing.  Looks kind of like spot editing in basic.  Maybe you just had really sharp focus on the eyes and ran a slight blur over the whole image.<br/>I really like the shot and she has a captivating expression.  The softness everywhere is just not to my taste.</td>', 'Very pretty subject and interesting use of light.  I''m a little concerned with the soft processing.  Looks kind of like spot editing in basic.  Maybe you just had really sharp focus on the eyes and ran a slight blur over the whole image.I really like the shot and she has a captivating expression.  The softness everywhere is just not to my taste.', '2008-01-11 23:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4386007, 629515, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice layout.  I wish you could have put a light behind the subject to bring out a little more of the face outline.  Just a thought - I could be wrong.</td>', 'Good idea and nice layout.  I wish you could have put a light behind the subject to bring out a little more of the face outline.  Just a thought - I could be wrong.', '2008-01-11 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4386017, 630257, 33400, '<td valign="top">Pretty good portrait, seemingly capturing a bit of his character.  I find myself wondering what he''s leaning on.  The cut out line is just enough to make me curious, but not enough to really see what it is.  If it was an obvious desk or counter top perhaps I would be less likely to give it a second thought.  Jut my humble opinion.</td>', 'Pretty good portrait, seemingly capturing a bit of his character.  I find myself wondering what he''s leaning on.  The cut out line is just enough to make me curious, but not enough to really see what it is.  If it was an obvious desk or counter top perhaps I would be less likely to give it a second thought.  Jut my humble opinion.', '2008-01-11 23:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
