(4387225, 629750, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, well done.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, well done.', '2008-01-12 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387227, 629953, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, however most of the photo appears to have a faint greenish cast to it... if there was any way to fix that that might improve the image. Otherwise this is great!</td>', 'This is nicely done, however most of the photo appears to have a faint greenish cast to it... if there was any way to fix that that might improve the image. Otherwise this is great!', '2008-01-12 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387233, 630773, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/> <br/>The lighting needs some work... the picture is a bit under-exposed. Secondly, it''s hard to tell, but I think the image might be just slightly out of focus. Also, I would advise not cropping the subject''s ear, and trying to create a more interesting composition. Excellent try though - I like what you were trying to capture here. :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :) The lighting needs some work... the picture is a bit under-exposed. Secondly, it''s hard to tell, but I think the image might be just slightly out of focus. Also, I would advise not cropping the subject''s ear, and trying to create a more interesting composition. Excellent try though - I like what you were trying to capture here. :)', '2008-01-12 15:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387234, 629497, 63269, '<td valign="top">My only complaint here is the cropping - with the subject''s ears and wrist cut off the photo feels somehow cramped for space. However, I really like the lighting!</td>', 'My only complaint here is the cropping - with the subject''s ears and wrist cut off the photo feels somehow cramped for space. However, I really like the lighting!', '2008-01-12 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387236, 628845, 63269, '<td valign="top">I was delighted when I saw this - the skillful lighting is so delicate. Everything is so soft, smooth, and lovely. And that expression is perfect. ;) I LOVE it!</td>', 'I was delighted when I saw this - the skillful lighting is so delicate. Everything is so soft, smooth, and lovely. And that expression is perfect. ;) I LOVE it!', '2008-01-12 15:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387238, 630240, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition - and great lighting! I like the many different contrasts and tones it creates.</td>', 'Interesting composition - and great lighting! I like the many different contrasts and tones it creates.', '2008-01-12 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387240, 630325, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wild! :) I like all the bright colors and contrasts here, and the way the sparks burst out from the corner is great. However, as much as I like the sparks... I personally think they have taken over the photo too much, and make the whole thing too confusing at first glance. If there had been any way to control the composition more, and perhaps take this from a slightly different angle so that the sparks didn''t cover up so much of the person, that might have helped. Excellent shot though! :)</td>', 'Wild! :) I like all the bright colors and contrasts here, and the way the sparks burst out from the corner is great. However, as much as I like the sparks... I personally think they have taken over the photo too much, and make the whole thing too confusing at first glance. If there had been any way to control the composition more, and perhaps take this from a slightly different angle so that the sparks didn''t cover up so much of the person, that might have helped. Excellent shot though! :)', '2008-01-12 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387244, 630626, 63269, '<td valign="top">Here''s my two cents... :)<br/> <br/>First of all, the image looks a little bit grainy. I''ve noticed sometimes that when I convert the image to black and white, that I''ll get the same grain on my images. I have no idea what the original shot looked like of course, but perhaps the color one would have worked better. Secondly the composition is rather akward. Half of the photo is the black lap-top screen. If there had been any way to move that out of the way that might have helped increase the impact of the photo. Also, there appears to be something that almost looks like dust on the right side of the photo. <br/> <br/>I hope this was helpful... I REALLY like the joyous expression you have captured on the woman''s face - beautiful! :)</td>', 'Here''s my two cents... :) First of all, the image looks a little bit grainy. I''ve noticed sometimes that when I convert the image to black and white, that I''ll get the same grain on my images. I have no idea what the original shot looked like of course, but perhaps the color one would have worked better. Secondly the composition is rather akward. Half of the photo is the black lap-top screen. If there had been any way to move that out of the way that might have helped increase the impact of the photo. Also, there appears to be something that almost looks like dust on the right side of the photo.  I hope this was helpful... I REALLY like the joyous expression you have captured on the woman''s face - beautiful! :)', '2008-01-12 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387245, 630558, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2008-01-12 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387258, 628605, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting - I like the stark contrasts here. The composition could use a bit more work perhaps, and also something to watch out for in future shots is the glasses... notice how they''ve made a "double" of the doggie''s eyes. Manipulating the angle of the camera might have solved this problem. Nice shot though! :)</td>', 'Very nice lighting - I like the stark contrasts here. The composition could use a bit more work perhaps, and also something to watch out for in future shots is the glasses... notice how they''ve made a "double" of the doggie''s eyes. Manipulating the angle of the camera might have solved this problem. Nice shot though! :)', '2008-01-12 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387353, 628708, 40580, '<td valign="top">Sorry, too grainy and soft for my tastes.<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'Sorry, too grainy and soft for my tastes. Good Luck', '2008-01-12 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4387421, 630278, 68035, '<td valign="top">My absolute favourite of the spectacles through glass type entries in this challenge...A really nice take on both the challenge and the delivery concept.  Outstanding focus on the reflected image and a very nice B&amp;W conversion</td>', 'My absolute favourite of the spectacles through glass type entries in this challenge...A really nice take on both the challenge and the delivery concept.  Outstanding focus on the reflected image and a very nice B&W conversion', '2008-01-12 17:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
