(4388236, 629072, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good fill-the-frame idea.  But a little dark.  Also there''s a bright spot on the forehead that''s a little distracting.  (I did the same thing on my entry.)</td>', 'Good fill-the-frame idea.  But a little dark.  Also there''s a bright spot on the forehead that''s a little distracting.  (I did the same thing on my entry.)', '2008-01-12 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
