(4388628, 630714, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image that tells your story of a bookworm pretty well. I think it could use some hue adjustment to pull down the greens. They seem a little heavy because of the background and the book itself.  Also, sharpening would have made her eyes brighter and brought out the specs more.</td>', 'This is a nice image that tells your story of a bookworm pretty well. I think it could use some hue adjustment to pull down the greens. They seem a little heavy because of the background and the book itself.  Also, sharpening would have made her eyes brighter and brought out the specs more.', '2008-01-13 08:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4388629, 630504, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very good use of light and contrast.  You manage to convey cheer, even with a dark shadowy background.<br/>Nice Image.</td>', 'Very good use of light and contrast.  You manage to convey cheer, even with a dark shadowy background.Nice Image.', '2008-01-13 08:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4388799, 630755, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is a classic, right out of a portrait studio-type portrait.  With perfect lighting.  It''s not in-your-face wow or trendy but it''s very, very well-done.  Nit: the model''s jacket needs a quick lint-rolling ;-)</td>', 'This is a classic, right out of a portrait studio-type portrait.  With perfect lighting.  It''s not in-your-face wow or trendy but it''s very, very well-done.  Nit: the model''s jacket needs a quick lint-rolling ;-)', '2008-01-13 10:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4388806, 630750, 88718, '<td valign="top">I think if you had stood back a little, the image in the glasses would have made more sense. This was a case of taking a number of shots at differing distances. I can imagine that shots like this are diffucult.</td>', 'I think if you had stood back a little, the image in the glasses would have made more sense. This was a case of taking a number of shots at differing distances. I can imagine that shots like this are diffucult.', '2008-01-13 10:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
