(4388969, 628924, 79357, '<td valign="top">scary skin smoothing</td>', 'scary skin smoothing', '2008-01-13 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4388996, 630804, 67237, '<td valign="top">good composition with some blown out parts<br/> <br/>back to bump +1, and leave some additional comments:<br/>the good: <br/>dof and wb look good, <br/>good expression and apropriate clothing for the story. <br/>the bad: <br/>too bad the right hand (a bit overexposed) merges with the blown out white books in the bg.<br/>spectacles'' frame is intersecting left eye (I can´t avoid seeing it all the time, not sure if this is "bad" though:-)). <br/>I would like to see better lighting control.</td>', 'good composition with some blown out parts back to bump +1, and leave some additional comments:the good: dof and wb look good, good expression and apropriate clothing for the story. the bad: too bad the right hand (a bit overexposed) merges with the blown out white books in the bg.spectacles'' frame is intersecting left eye (I can´t avoid seeing it all the time, not sure if this is "bad" though:-)). I would like to see better lighting control.', '2008-01-13 12:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
