(4389189, 630792, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, we know the pretty girls with glasses shots will do well. This is very good. It looks like some real time and effort went into putting this together. Her expression is interesting, like she is getting ready to ask a question.</td>', 'Well, we know the pretty girls with glasses shots will do well. This is very good. It looks like some real time and effort went into putting this together. Her expression is interesting, like she is getting ready to ask a question.', '2008-01-13 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
