(4390170, 630704, 83313, '<td valign="top">A decent enough shot, but that huge expanse of empty space between the two subjects does not work for me. It breaks up the composition and it is where my eye wanders, looking for something that is not there.. A different perspective or crop may have appealed to me more.</td>', 'A decent enough shot, but that huge expanse of empty space between the two subjects does not work for me. It breaks up the composition and it is where my eye wanders, looking for something that is not there.. A different perspective or crop may have appealed to me more.', '2008-01-13 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390177, 629576, 10818, '<td valign="top">Red sweater works well, background is pretty. Nice contrast of colors.  A little more crop on the right may work better to get rid of the tee pee thing.</td>', 'Red sweater works well, background is pretty. Nice contrast of colors.  A little more crop on the right may work better to get rid of the tee pee thing.', '2008-01-13 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
