(4390196, 630800, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl, but a little heavy on the noise reduction/smoothing for my taste.  Otherwise, a good portrait.  Well lit and good colors.</td>', 'Very pretty girl, but a little heavy on the noise reduction/smoothing for my taste.  Otherwise, a good portrait.  Well lit and good colors.', '2008-01-13 23:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
