(4390202, 630785, 33400, '<td valign="top">Excellent crisp detail on his face.  Not too sure about the band of light on the forehead - it''s a little distracting.  I saw that before I noticed the very well shot "scruffy" beard.</td>', 'Excellent crisp detail on his face.  Not too sure about the band of light on the forehead - it''s a little distracting.  I saw that before I noticed the very well shot "scruffy" beard.', '2008-01-13 23:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390204, 629881, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I have her for 8th grade algebra? (Probably not, that woman would be about 55 now...)<br/> <br/>An enticing and very sexy shot. Love her eyes. I didn''t notice any spectacles, though. Were there spectacles involved here?</td>', 'Didn''t I have her for 8th grade algebra? (Probably not, that woman would be about 55 now...) An enticing and very sexy shot. Love her eyes. I didn''t notice any spectacles, though. Were there spectacles involved here?', '2008-01-13 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390209, 630342, 33400, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot and pretty subject.  The shine on the forehead is too noticeable.  I did this on my entry too, and frankly am not certain what is the best way to prevent it in basic editing where you can''t soften it with Photoshop.<br/>Good portrait.</td>', 'Nicely shot and pretty subject.  The shine on the forehead is too noticeable.  I did this on my entry too, and frankly am not certain what is the best way to prevent it in basic editing where you can''t soften it with Photoshop.Good portrait.', '2008-01-13 23:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
