(4393612, 629515, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing use of lighting...  My only complaint is that either the quality of the image is a little low or there is some grian. Neat shot though!</td>', 'Very intriguing use of lighting...  My only complaint is that either the quality of the image is a little low or there is some grian. Neat shot though!', '2008-01-15 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393614, 630244, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of the details here. Nicely lit!</td>', 'I like the clarity of the details here. Nicely lit!', '2008-01-15 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393615, 630327, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent and interesting pose here, but the image is slightly out of focus. If you could fix that, it would greatly increase the photo''s impact! :)</td>', 'Excellent and interesting pose here, but the image is slightly out of focus. If you could fix that, it would greatly increase the photo''s impact! :)', '2008-01-15 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393616, 630627, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting!', '2008-01-15 11:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393618, 630584, 63269, '<td valign="top">SUPERB lighting - VERY well done!! I love the textures and the lines of highlight on the guitar and then on his jacket seams as well. Great image.</td>', 'SUPERB lighting - VERY well done!! I love the textures and the lines of highlight on the guitar and then on his jacket seams as well. Great image.', '2008-01-15 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393625, 630724, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great shot! It is perfectly exposed. My only complaint is that the flash has created a shadow from her hand... Maybe there wasn''t, but if there had been any way to light this from the side somehow, perhaps that would have fixed it. Just a thought... otherwise this is nice! :)</td>', 'Great shot! It is perfectly exposed. My only complaint is that the flash has created a shadow from her hand... Maybe there wasn''t, but if there had been any way to light this from the side somehow, perhaps that would have fixed it. Just a thought... otherwise this is nice! :)', '2008-01-15 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393626, 630528, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors and perfect focus.</td>', 'I like the bright colors and perfect focus.', '2008-01-15 11:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393690, 629410, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image! I personally might have tried to take the photo from a different angle or tilted the subject''s head in a slighly different way however... because although I like the way she is looking towards the camera out of the corner of her eyes, it has caused the pupil in the farthest eye to disappear, leaving it all white. So maybe a different POV. But this is so beautiful - I LOVE the rich colors of her hair and the tones and contrasts are lovely! :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful image! I personally might have tried to take the photo from a different angle or tilted the subject''s head in a slighly different way however... because although I like the way she is looking towards the camera out of the corner of her eyes, it has caused the pupil in the farthest eye to disappear, leaving it all white. So maybe a different POV. But this is so beautiful - I LOVE the rich colors of her hair and the tones and contrasts are lovely! :)', '2008-01-15 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393693, 630813, 53147, '<td valign="top">I would but I would be afraid you would come down and kick my butt. ;)</td>', 'I would but I would be afraid you would come down and kick my butt. ;)', '2008-01-15 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393695, 630343, 63269, '<td valign="top">Taking this from a different point of view might increase the impact of this shot... Try moving the camera down to the dog''s eye-level to make this more interesting. Be sure to watch your background when you do that, however, and avoid messy and cluttered backgrounds. Excellent try though! :)</td>', 'Taking this from a different point of view might increase the impact of this shot... Try moving the camera down to the dog''s eye-level to make this more interesting. Be sure to watch your background when you do that, however, and avoid messy and cluttered backgrounds. Excellent try though! :)', '2008-01-15 12:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393701, 630628, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting! I only wish I could see the headphones (?) a little better, because at first glance, I''m not sure what they are, and my eyes want to dismiss it as clutter that shouldn''t be there. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Excellent lighting! I only wish I could see the headphones (?) a little better, because at first glance, I''m not sure what they are, and my eyes want to dismiss it as clutter that shouldn''t be there. Just a thought. :)', '2008-01-15 12:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393707, 629118, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :) It would be nice if that stray hair across the cheek were gone, and also I would suggest not cropping that other eye in half... however, I love the high contrasts and black and white here - beautiful!</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :) It would be nice if that stray hair across the cheek were gone, and also I would suggest not cropping that other eye in half... however, I love the high contrasts and black and white here - beautiful!', '2008-01-15 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393712, 630741, 63269, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this! Splendid idea and very well done. A 9 from me!! :)</td>', 'I LOVE this! Splendid idea and very well done. A 9 from me!! :)', '2008-01-15 12:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393718, 629332, 63269, '<td valign="top">I guess you''ve probably already been scolded about this in lots of other comments, :) but I personally don''t think this is a portrait. However it is a terrific image - the shallow DOF, bright colors, and vivid contrasts all work together to create an awesome shot.</td>', 'I guess you''ve probably already been scolded about this in lots of other comments, :) but I personally don''t think this is a portrait. However it is a terrific image - the shallow DOF, bright colors, and vivid contrasts all work together to create an awesome shot.', '2008-01-15 12:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393722, 630795, 63269, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and I love the crystal-clear details! My only suggestion is to watch out for what the lense on the right side of the photo is creating a double line of the face. But that''s just a minor nit-pick. Nice image!</td>', 'Great lighting, and I love the crystal-clear details! My only suggestion is to watch out for what the lense on the right side of the photo is creating a double line of the face. But that''s just a minor nit-pick. Nice image!', '2008-01-15 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393723, 630780, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrasts and bizarre colors. Nice!</td>', 'I love the high contrasts and bizarre colors. Nice!', '2008-01-15 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393818, 630467, 88680, '<td valign="top">Snitch</td>', 'Snitch', '2008-01-15 13:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393889, 630627, 88545, '<td valign="top">sexy!</td>', 'sexy!', '2008-01-15 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393891, 630624, 88545, '<td valign="top">Hottie!</td>', 'Hottie!', '2008-01-15 13:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393894, 630470, 88545, '<td valign="top">eww</td>', 'eww', '2008-01-15 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4393976, 630613, 78196, '<td valign="top">Good but quite seriously over-sharpened.</td>', 'Good but quite seriously over-sharpened.', '2008-01-15 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394002, 630077, 67237, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of a beautyfully textured subject. I just wonder why some parts are blurred and others at same distance from camera are not. I hope it is not an artificially created dof</td>', 'Interesting capture of a beautyfully textured subject. I just wonder why some parts are blurred and others at same distance from camera are not. I hope it is not an artificially created dof', '2008-01-15 14:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394054, 628845, 78110, '<td valign="top">love it..just right side a litte to much light..but still good one!</td>', 'love it..just right side a litte to much light..but still good one!', '2008-01-15 15:13:08.000000', NULL, 1);
