(4394129, 630511, 811, '<td valign="top">great lighting !</td>', 'great lighting !', '2008-01-15 15:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394132, 629882, 811, '<td valign="top">i like the composition on this.  has a very glamour/fashion feeling to it</td>', 'i like the composition on this.  has a very glamour/fashion feeling to it', '2008-01-15 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394134, 630265, 811, '<td valign="top">i really like the lighting and i like how the blue in the shirt and the blue in the reflection complement eachother</td>', 'i really like the lighting and i like how the blue in the shirt and the blue in the reflection complement eachother', '2008-01-15 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394135, 630448, 811, '<td valign="top">great perspective and very humourous and creative take on the challenge.  i think this is my favorite in this challenge</td>', 'great perspective and very humourous and creative take on the challenge.  i think this is my favorite in this challenge', '2008-01-15 15:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394136, 630785, 811, '<td valign="top">he looks amused but relaxed.  i like the composition</td>', 'he looks amused but relaxed.  i like the composition', '2008-01-15 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394145, 630459, 41864, '<td valign="top">very clever title and shot.</td>', 'very clever title and shot.', '2008-01-15 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394161, 629394, 41864, '<td valign="top">A dead cert! very funny!</td>', 'A dead cert! very funny!', '2008-01-15 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394164, 630330, 811, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  the noise/grain from saturation/desaturation (????) is a bit distracting, though.</td>', 'interesting shot.  the noise/grain from saturation/desaturation (????) is a bit distracting, though.', '2008-01-15 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394167, 629197, 41864, '<td valign="top">so cute.</td>', 'so cute.', '2008-01-15 16:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394168, 628708, 811, '<td valign="top">sharper focus would help this be much more effective.  It almost looks like you have cropped it out of a larger picture, and it got all pixelated on you.</td>', 'sharper focus would help this be much more effective.  It almost looks like you have cropped it out of a larger picture, and it got all pixelated on you.', '2008-01-15 16:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394174, 629953, 811, '<td valign="top">the pose seems a bit contrived.  Maybe a tighter crop of just her face and flower would help.  her shoulders just seem a bit too tense.  also the lighting is a bit harsh.  Maybe a darker background and lit from one side or bounced from behind would make it more dramatic/effective.</td>', 'the pose seems a bit contrived.  Maybe a tighter crop of just her face and flower would help.  her shoulders just seem a bit too tense.  also the lighting is a bit harsh.  Maybe a darker background and lit from one side or bounced from behind would make it more dramatic/effective.', '2008-01-15 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394177, 628924, 811, '<td valign="top">the pose and composition is good.  it seems to be the victim of a touch too much neat image/noise reduction though</td>', 'the pose and composition is good.  it seems to be the victim of a touch too much neat image/noise reduction though', '2008-01-15 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394180, 630705, 811, '<td valign="top">interesting idea/concept.  doesn''t feel quite natural, though -- it looks like they were posing for you</td>', 'interesting idea/concept.  doesn''t feel quite natural, though -- it looks like they were posing for you', '2008-01-15 16:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394181, 630815, 811, '<td valign="top">would make a good abstract and i like the colors of it.  not sure about the "portrait" aspect of it, but hey, whatever.</td>', 'would make a good abstract and i like the colors of it.  not sure about the "portrait" aspect of it, but hey, whatever.', '2008-01-15 16:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394182, 630420, 811, '<td valign="top">a sharper focus would have really added to this shot.</td>', 'a sharper focus would have really added to this shot.', '2008-01-15 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394187, 630754, 811, '<td valign="top">good pose.  the colors seem a bit saturated.  is his hair really green?</td>', 'good pose.  the colors seem a bit saturated.  is his hair really green?', '2008-01-15 16:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394198, 629086, 88590, '<td valign="top">nice colours, sharp, good crop, and he looks relaxed and happy!</td>', 'nice colours, sharp, good crop, and he looks relaxed and happy!', '2008-01-15 16:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394200, 630532, 41864, '<td valign="top">how cute. photo is grainy though...pity</td>', 'how cute. photo is grainy though...pity', '2008-01-15 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394203, 630637, 88590, '<td valign="top">very interesting...  good choice of colours / composition / posing / lighting.</td>', 'very interesting...  good choice of colours / composition / posing / lighting.', '2008-01-15 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394209, 630697, 41864, '<td valign="top">love this shot. just a small thing....wish her hair was not behind the chair.</td>', 'love this shot. just a small thing....wish her hair was not behind the chair.', '2008-01-15 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394213, 630792, 41864, '<td valign="top">great shot, eyes are stunning, great focus. her strap is a little distracting</td>', 'great shot, eyes are stunning, great focus. her strap is a little distracting', '2008-01-15 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394218, 630279, 88590, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting</td>', 'very nice lighting', '2008-01-15 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394223, 630740, 41864, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites. well done</td>', 'one of my favourites. well done', '2008-01-15 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394229, 630042, 41864, '<td valign="top">really like this. great b &amp; w''s</td>', 'really like this. great b & w''s', '2008-01-15 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394230, 630697, 88590, '<td valign="top">very, very nice - i wish you luck</td>', 'very, very nice - i wish you luck', '2008-01-15 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394234, 629058, 41864, '<td valign="top">like the title!!</td>', 'like the title!!', '2008-01-15 16:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394270, 630811, 63269, '<td valign="top">This might look better with slightly more contrast.</td>', 'This might look better with slightly more contrast.', '2008-01-15 16:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394271, 630511, 63269, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting - awesome contrasts, tones, and focus as well.</td>', 'Superb lighting - awesome contrasts, tones, and focus as well.', '2008-01-15 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394272, 628595, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2008-01-15 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394274, 630540, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like all the character you''ve captured here - well done! :D</td>', 'I like all the character you''ve captured here - well done! :D', '2008-01-15 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394288, 629427, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/>First of all, the image is a bit blurry. Making sure everything is focused and sharp is key to getting a good shot. Also her glasses frames are blocking her eyes a bit, something I personally might have tried to avoid by taking this from a different angle... Then there''s the pose - she looks like she''s reaching up for something, giving this a sort of snap-shot like feel. Not that candids are bad or anything, but the position she is in looks a little akward. <br/>Hope this was helpful. :) Very good work on the lighting though - it''s beautiful!</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :)First of all, the image is a bit blurry. Making sure everything is focused and sharp is key to getting a good shot. Also her glasses frames are blocking her eyes a bit, something I personally might have tried to avoid by taking this from a different angle... Then there''s the pose - she looks like she''s reaching up for something, giving this a sort of snap-shot like feel. Not that candids are bad or anything, but the position she is in looks a little akward. Hope this was helpful. :) Very good work on the lighting though - it''s beautiful!', '2008-01-15 17:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394296, 629058, 63269, '<td valign="top">LOL! I love the stark contrasts here, and those faces are hilarious!</td>', 'LOL! I love the stark contrasts here, and those faces are hilarious!', '2008-01-15 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394299, 630265, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color - neat work!</td>', 'Excellent use of color - neat work!', '2008-01-15 17:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394302, 630416, 63269, '<td valign="top">I only wish this were in focus... also, maybe this was intentional, but the colors and contrasts are a little pale and washed out. Personally I would have tried to get more colors and contrast, but maybe that''s just me. I love the expression of the subject though... this is very beautiful!</td>', 'I only wish this were in focus... also, maybe this was intentional, but the colors and contrasts are a little pale and washed out. Personally I would have tried to get more colors and contrast, but maybe that''s just me. I love the expression of the subject though... this is very beautiful!', '2008-01-15 17:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394305, 628923, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the shadows the lighting creates, or the way the hair and the sweater blend into the background... but the clarity of details is great!</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the shadows the lighting creates, or the way the hair and the sweater blend into the background... but the clarity of details is great!', '2008-01-15 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394309, 630546, 63269, '<td valign="top">VERY well done! It is sooo hard to photograph black animals, but you''ve exposed the rabit <i>perfectly </i>with nice soft light. Beautiful work!</td>', 'VERY well done! It is sooo hard to photograph black animals, but you''ve exposed the rabit perfectly with nice soft light. Beautiful work!', '2008-01-15 17:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394310, 630750, 63269, '<td valign="top">VERY neat effect!</td>', 'VERY neat effect!', '2008-01-15 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394314, 630632, 63269, '<td valign="top">If there had been any way to avoid those blown-out highlights on the side of her face, that might have made this a better shot. Good try though! :)</td>', 'If there had been any way to avoid those blown-out highlights on the side of her face, that might have made this a better shot. Good try though! :)', '2008-01-15 17:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394315, 630077, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful captured, and excellent lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful captured, and excellent lighting.', '2008-01-15 17:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394321, 629214, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting! My only suggestion would be to fix the cropping... I personally would have either avoided cropping the top of the head, or I might have gone all the way and cropped another chunk off. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Excellent lighting! My only suggestion would be to fix the cropping... I personally would have either avoided cropping the top of the head, or I might have gone all the way and cropped another chunk off. Just a thought. :)', '2008-01-15 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394324, 629291, 63269, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably already been bombarded with "DNMC" comments... but I personally do not see this as a portrait. It is a neat shot though! :)</td>', 'You''ve probably already been bombarded with "DNMC" comments... but I personally do not see this as a portrait. It is a neat shot though! :)', '2008-01-15 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394333, 630270, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this might look with a bit more contrast? There is nothing white in the picture - only black and gray - making everything look a bit flat. The composition is nice though. :)</td>', 'I wonder how this might look with a bit more contrast? There is nothing white in the picture - only black and gray - making everything look a bit flat. The composition is nice though. :)', '2008-01-15 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394336, 629904, 63269, '<td valign="top">The saturation and color look a bit off on my screen - but the lighting and focus are good.</td>', 'The saturation and color look a bit off on my screen - but the lighting and focus are good.', '2008-01-15 17:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394344, 630506, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting - and the way her hair falls across her face is splendid.</td>', 'Lovely lighting - and the way her hair falls across her face is splendid.', '2008-01-15 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394363, 630625, 33400, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. And it''s hard to make spectacles interesting.  Wish you could have had bigger DOF to get the stars on the ends of the specs in focus.</td>', 'Fun idea. And it''s hard to make spectacles interesting.  Wish you could have had bigger DOF to get the stars on the ends of the specs in focus.', '2008-01-15 17:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394364, 630329, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good image, agree with the sentiment.  This is not really a portrait though.</td>', 'Good image, agree with the sentiment.  This is not really a portrait though.', '2008-01-15 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394368, 629898, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good idea and clever set up.  I wish you could have cleaned the lens of the specs a little more.  The smudges are distracting.<br/>Still, an interesting take on the idea.</td>', 'Good idea and clever set up.  I wish you could have cleaned the lens of the specs a little more.  The smudges are distracting.Still, an interesting take on the idea.', '2008-01-15 17:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394372, 630755, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good portrait, well shot.  I had the same problem with shine on the forehead in my entry.  Seems like a problem in basic editing.</td>', 'Good portrait, well shot.  I had the same problem with shine on the forehead in my entry.  Seems like a problem in basic editing.', '2008-01-15 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394374, 630706, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very good portrayal of a character.  He seems genuine and very intense.<br/>Good shot.</td>', 'Very good portrayal of a character.  He seems genuine and very intense.Good shot.', '2008-01-15 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394376, 630324, 33400, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect with this shot.  She''s made up a bit heavily - bit I assume that''s what you''re going for.  Good shot.</td>', 'The title is perfect with this shot.  She''s made up a bit heavily - bit I assume that''s what you''re going for.  Good shot.', '2008-01-15 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394377, 630077, 33400, '<td valign="top">There is so much character on the faces of the elderly.  Mother has a long life to tell about and this shot expresses that very well.</td>', 'There is so much character on the faces of the elderly.  Mother has a long life to tell about and this shot expresses that very well.', '2008-01-15 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394378, 630517, 33400, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get it.  I kept thinking: How can this be a self portrait when I can clearly see someone else holding the camera, no tripod.<br/> <br/>Then AHA.<br/> <br/>Good shot</td>', 'Took me a minute to get it.  I kept thinking: How can this be a self portrait when I can clearly see someone else holding the camera, no tripod. Then AHA. Good shot', '2008-01-15 18:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
