(4395998, 630162, 7889, '<td valign="top">Loved this ! B&amp;W works here, colour would not, I knew this would not please the majority here but dont change the way you take pictures to please the masses.</td>', 'Loved this ! B&W works here, colour would not, I knew this would not please the majority here but dont change the way you take pictures to please the masses.', '2008-01-16 06:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4396005, 630420, 84320, '<td valign="top">Arf !<br/> <br/>It''s the first time I view my pic from another computer, it didn''t look like this on the computer I post-treated it !!!<br/>I''m currently travelling in India so I have to treat my pics in cyber-cafes. I guess the comp I used had a much brighter screen (too bright It seems)...<br/> <br/>Good thing I kept the RAW file, it will have to wait till I get back home though.<br/> <br/>Too bad for this challenge =(</td>', 'Arf ! It''s the first time I view my pic from another computer, it didn''t look like this on the computer I post-treated it !!!I''m currently travelling in India so I have to treat my pics in cyber-cafes. I guess the comp I used had a much brighter screen (too bright It seems)... Good thing I kept the RAW file, it will have to wait till I get back home though. Too bad for this challenge =(', '2008-01-16 06:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
