(4396153, 628923, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well, Peter, we were almost right next to each other in the finish, but your entry was much, much stronger than mine. It is very well lit and has the correct color balance (you were right about mine - it was an orange accident that I tried and couldn''t quite correct). Very nice work!</td>', 'Well, Peter, we were almost right next to each other in the finish, but your entry was much, much stronger than mine. It is very well lit and has the correct color balance (you were right about mine - it was an orange accident that I tried and couldn''t quite correct). Very nice work!', '2008-01-16 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4396159, 630706, 23484, '<td valign="top">Catherine, very nice shot. I really like how you cropped it. The lighting seems a bit off though. I can''t quite put my finger on it though. Nice job.</td>', 'Catherine, very nice shot. I really like how you cropped it. The lighting seems a bit off though. I can''t quite put my finger on it though. Nice job.', '2008-01-16 08:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
