(4396336, 629552, 66384, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this didn''t place higher. I thought it was the strongest of the challenge. I don''t agree with some of the commenters that a portrait must be planned and set up. Capturing a great face with character in good light is an excellent way to make a portrait. I say well done, and keep shooting portraits. I think you have a knack for it.</td>', 'I am surprised this didn''t place higher. I thought it was the strongest of the challenge. I don''t agree with some of the commenters that a portrait must be planned and set up. Capturing a great face with character in good light is an excellent way to make a portrait. I say well done, and keep shooting portraits. I think you have a knack for it.', '2008-01-16 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
