(4398223, 629529, 76430, '<td valign="top">Kendall,<br/> <br/>I see you''ve been registered for nearly 3 years and this was your first photo submitted.  I''ll have to assume you are one of those that just likes to look at photos here and maybe vote, but you came across an amusing situation in life that matched a competition and you decided to share it with us.  Nothing wrong with that.  Welcome to the contributers, and feel free to submit any time you want.  Please don''t take any of the comments personnally.  They are just critiques of the technical (and taste!) aspects of the picture and though you have a decent camera (based on the looks; you have the highest rated, and only, photo submitted with it) you may not have good editing software.<br/> <br/>Boyd</td>', 'Kendall, I see you''ve been registered for nearly 3 years and this was your first photo submitted.  I''ll have to assume you are one of those that just likes to look at photos here and maybe vote, but you came across an amusing situation in life that matched a competition and you decided to share it with us.  Nothing wrong with that.  Welcome to the contributers, and feel free to submit any time you want.  Please don''t take any of the comments personnally.  They are just critiques of the technical (and taste!) aspects of the picture and though you have a decent camera (based on the looks; you have the highest rated, and only, photo submitted with it) you may not have good editing software. Boyd', '2008-01-16 20:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
