(4401077, 628845, 68947, '<td valign="top"><i>Not sure why this took first place, it''s burned out and not very interesting. Hmm</i> <br/> <br/><b>Perhaps, some "spectacles" may help??? :)</b> <br/> <br/>Lovely shot Tim!  This must have been a difficult capture!  Three year olds are notorious for sitting still at the best of times, let alone when trying to focus and get lighting right!  I find this an interesting shot because it''s quite a "natural" look on this child''s face, even though it likely took about 50 shots to get it "right" *smile*  Congratulations! Very well deserved!</td>', 'Not sure why this took first place, it''s burned out and not very interesting. Hmm  Perhaps, some "spectacles" may help??? :)  Lovely shot Tim!  This must have been a difficult capture!  Three year olds are notorious for sitting still at the best of times, let alone when trying to focus and get lighting right!  I find this an interesting shot because it''s quite a "natural" look on this child''s face, even though it likely took about 50 shots to get it "right" *smile*  Congratulations! Very well deserved!', '2008-01-17 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
