(4401817, 630781, 32933, '<td valign="top">Maybe people would have gotten the point better if it were shown to be a Gideon Bible? I don''t know if that''s true, but it''s an idea. I do love what you did here after reading everything, though.<br/> <br/>For some reason, the photo itself looks Gospel-y. It''s like the way the light is used is similar to what''s been used in evangelists'' shows and in photos for Gospel singers and Christian websites. Sorry I can''t be more technical; I hope you get what I''m saying. Those types of photos tend to make me a little sick just because I''ve seen them so much, but I <i>really</i> like that the style of the photograph fits in with the idea behind it.</td>', 'Maybe people would have gotten the point better if it were shown to be a Gideon Bible? I don''t know if that''s true, but it''s an idea. I do love what you did here after reading everything, though. For some reason, the photo itself looks Gospel-y. It''s like the way the light is used is similar to what''s been used in evangelists'' shows and in photos for Gospel singers and Christian websites. Sorry I can''t be more technical; I hope you get what I''m saying. Those types of photos tend to make me a little sick just because I''ve seen them so much, but I really like that the style of the photograph fits in with the idea behind it.', '2008-01-18 01:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
