(4402062, 630240, 47483, '<td valign="top">kindaaa liked it, specially the framing.</td>', 'kindaaa liked it, specially the framing.', '2008-01-18 07:58:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4402488, 630781, 5885, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zillahlewis:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe people would have gotten the point better if it were shown to be a Gideon Bible? I don''t know if that''s true, but it''s an idea. I do love what you did here after reading everything, though.<br/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ya know, when I rented the room, I was hoping that a Gideon Bible would be in there. Unfortunately and according to my luck, there wasn''t. I hoped the curtains and rough fabric chair would be good enough clues. I did include the AC unit in some outtakes, but it just looked tacky and the composition was horrible.</td>', 'Originally posted by zillahlewis: Maybe people would have gotten the point better if it were shown to be a Gideon Bible? I don''t know if that''s true, but it''s an idea. I do love what you did here after reading everything, though.   Ya know, when I rented the room, I was hoping that a Gideon Bible would be in there. Unfortunately and according to my luck, there wasn''t. I hoped the curtains and rough fabric chair would be good enough clues. I did include the AC unit in some outtakes, but it just looked tacky and the composition was horrible.', '2008-01-18 12:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
