(4405155, 630665, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TonyT:</b></div><hr/><i>Just try to put a pair of glasses on 2 dogs and get them to sit there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''ve done it to one once and that''s why I''m in awe (and in Awwwwwwe) of this. Robbed of a ribbon by the pet pic haters, I think.</td>', 'Originally posted by TonyT:Just try to put a pair of glasses on 2 dogs and get them to sit there.  I''ve done it to one once and that''s why I''m in awe (and in Awwwwwwe) of this. Robbed of a ribbon by the pet pic haters, I think.', '2008-01-19 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4405224, 630781, 75034, '<td valign="top">Leroy, I''m angry with myself for missing the voting on this challenge. You would have received another 10 for your efforts with this shot. I think that photography should challenge people to look hard into themselves and see the world as others do. This shot showes (to me anyway) the juxtaposition that people have with religion and nudity. People are often conflicted and ashamed to have such thoughts. Good on you to go against the grain and follow your creative side. You managed to piss off 38 people (12 royaly and wishing they could give you zero or worse no doubt) and still finish in the top 100. Now that''s saying something. My hat goes off to you. Keep the faith my brother and hold true to your art.<br/>I for one wish I had thought of that (and could find a model to shoot it) and I''m sure that I''m not the only one.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Leroy, I''m angry with myself for missing the voting on this challenge. You would have received another 10 for your efforts with this shot. I think that photography should challenge people to look hard into themselves and see the world as others do. This shot showes (to me anyway) the juxtaposition that people have with religion and nudity. People are often conflicted and ashamed to have such thoughts. Good on you to go against the grain and follow your creative side. You managed to piss off 38 people (12 royaly and wishing they could give you zero or worse no doubt) and still finish in the top 100. Now that''s saying something. My hat goes off to you. Keep the faith my brother and hold true to your art.I for one wish I had thought of that (and could find a model to shoot it) and I''m sure that I''m not the only one. MAX!', '2008-01-19 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
