(5831990, 628976, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t see why this got a 3.8. Under 5, yes, I can see that, but under 4 is harsh. The idea here is funny! The flash however gives a very harsh light, something to soften it up would defintely improve the photo. Hold a piece of white printpaper in front of it or something to soften it up. It can help! Also, a big towel or a bedsheet as a background would have a more solid and comfortable background. In this case, maybe a very bright one since it''s very dark back there (maybe) COULD give some balance to it. The blue frame is a bit to blue. If you''re using photoshop you could steal the dark blue colors from the pillow and add that as a canvas instead. I tried it, and it really worked! I also did a quick fix with Levels, only dragged the white one to get into the histogram, really helped.</td>', 'I don''t see why this got a 3.8. Under 5, yes, I can see that, but under 4 is harsh. The idea here is funny! The flash however gives a very harsh light, something to soften it up would defintely improve the photo. Hold a piece of white printpaper in front of it or something to soften it up. It can help! Also, a big towel or a bedsheet as a background would have a more solid and comfortable background. In this case, maybe a very bright one since it''s very dark back there (maybe) COULD give some balance to it. The blue frame is a bit to blue. If you''re using photoshop you could steal the dark blue colors from the pillow and add that as a canvas instead. I tried it, and it really worked! I also did a quick fix with Levels, only dragged the white one to get into the histogram, really helped.', '2010-01-25 11:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6171751, 630810, 53147, '<td valign="top">Browsing through my faves and came across this again. Man I love this shot. I bet she is getting big now. Hope all is well.</td>', 'Browsing through my faves and came across this again. Man I love this shot. I bet she is getting big now. Hope all is well.', '2010-09-25 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6199403, 629882, 91783, '<td valign="top">i finally decided to look at your portfolio. Love this image. :) i dont care about the splotches or how light her skin is. the pale or light color of skin is fantastic! i think that it adds a lot to the shot. i think that her lips and skin tone make a wonderful contrast. I like the empty space to the left. over all i think you should have gotten a ribbon, but i suppose getting 4th isnt too bad either. <br/> <br/>Fantastic job over all! (maybe if another self portrait challenge comes up we can go head to head.)</td>', 'i finally decided to look at your portfolio. Love this image. :) i dont care about the splotches or how light her skin is. the pale or light color of skin is fantastic! i think that it adds a lot to the shot. i think that her lips and skin tone make a wonderful contrast. I like the empty space to the left. over all i think you should have gotten a ribbon, but i suppose getting 4th isnt too bad either.  Fantastic job over all! (maybe if another self portrait challenge comes up we can go head to head.)', '2010-10-23 18:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
